,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":6250,"atk":130,"def":700,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"sanguine_rockbreaker":{"slug":"sanguine_rockbreaker","name":"Sanguine Rockbreaker","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sanguine Rockbreaker.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"How does moss lift a rock? The Army's researchers tried gene sequencing, chemicals, etc. Until one day its spores fell upon the carcass of a mutated animal. It is quite happy about what happened—people now run away from it screaming. This once insignificant creature has finally earned respect.","abilities":["Splits when first affected by a <Leak Source>."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":500,"def":1700,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.3}},"leak_source":{"slug":"leak_source","name":"Leak Source","icon":"/enemies-icons/Leak Source.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"People would bring tuskbeasts and let them howl at anyone running a fever, believing that their cry would scare away the evil spirits haunting the patient—that is, until the tuskbeasts began running fevers too.","abilities":["Cannot be attacked","Not visible normally; increases ATK when it reveals itself.","Periodically fires a ring of beams that cause the first allied unit hit to take continuous True damage for a period of time, with closer units taking higher damage more frequently. When a beam hits a target, it accelerates the process of revealing the source.","Reveals itself after some time, firing more beams more frequently; leaves the field some time after revealing itself.","Revealed when an Operator is deployed on its tile or the four adjacent tiles; during this period, beams only affect the earliest-deployed Operator nearby; leaves the field after some time and gives all allied Operators SP."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":15,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":0.5}},"angry_shishiga":{"slug":"angry_shishiga","name":"Angry 'Shishiga'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Angry 'Shishiga'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"When the monsters take to the streets for the first time, their deformed limbs slapping people's homes, the people finally realize what experiments occurred in the secretive underground laboratories. They will no longer be slow, when their potential is fully unleashed.","abilities":["Next attack hits three times when affected by a <Leak Source>."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":2100,"def":800,"res":25,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":6}},"sanguine_trimortalis":{"slug":"sanguine_trimortalis","name":"Sanguine Trimortalis","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sanguine Trimortalis.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Some Ursines believe that these terrifying flowers were watered with the cursed blood of those suffering from the strange sickness. This is partially correct, but they were fed more than just blood.","abilities":["Deals Physical damage to the target when attacked.","Physical damage dealt to attacker temporarily increases and gains splash when affected by a <Leak Source>."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":27500,"atk":600,"def":300,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"ama_10":{"slug":"ama_10","name":"AMa-10","icon":"/enemies-icons/AMa-10.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackP